      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "go build -gcflags=-m  |  Compiler SSA pass decides: does this variable outlive its stack frame?  Stack = free. Heap = GC cost.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
