      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "// Functions over 80 AST nodes\n// are NOT inlined by default:\n// go:noinline pragma forces no-inline\n// Use: go build -gcflags='-m=2'\n// to see inlining decisions:\n// 'inlining call to newInt'\n// 'cannot inline: too complex'",
